# TEMPORARY SHADOW of the same resource inside ai.pipestream:opennlp-runtime.
#
# The published 3.x-preview-SNAPSHOT jars bake "OpenNLP-Version:
# 3.x-preview-SNAPSHOT" here, and OpenNLP's own Version.parse requires
# major.minor.patch, so every BaseModel create/load throws
# NumberFormatException before doing anything. Project resources precede
# dependency jars on the classpath, so this parseable stand-in wins.
#
# DELETE this file the moment the fork publishes a parseable version string
# (e.g. 3.0.0-preview-SNAPSHOT) in its own opennlp.version resource.
OpenNLP-Version: 3.0.0-SNAPSHOT
